  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let the point on the circle be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and foot&nbsp;of the perpendicular from a point on the circle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> to the plane <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/8ad528c6-976a-4091-8647-5bba5ff7e6d1-image.png\" style=\"width: 264px; height: 180px;\" /></p><p>Now using foot of perpendicular formula we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>14</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>14</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><mn>14</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now again from equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>14</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow><mn>14</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now eliminating <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math>&nbsp;from equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Again from equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>14</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now from equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
